# Example edit script for mc-cli (see crates/mc-cli/src/script.rs).
# Two tracks, a pickup, a repeated section, a tempo change, ties and an overfull bar.
insert-bars 1 4
pickup 0 on
beat 0 0 0 0 q
note 0 0 0 0 1 3
beat 0 1 0 0 q.
note 0 1 0 0 1 3
tie 0 1 0 0 1 on
beat 0 1 0 1 e/3
beat 0 1 0 2 e/3
beat 0 1 0 3 e/3
note 0 1 0 1 2 5
note 0 1 0 2 2 6
note 0 1 0 3 2 7
beat 0 1 0 4 q.
repeat 1 2 2
tempo 3 96
add-track Rhythm
tuning 1 E4,B3,G3,D3,A2,D2 22 2
beat 1 2 0 0 w
note 1 2 0 0 6 0
note 1 2 0 0 5 2
note 1 2 0 0 4 2
# Overfull bar 3 on the rhythm track: a diagnostic, not an error (Q-09).
beat 1 3 0 0 w
beat 1 3 0 1 q
time 4 6/8
shift 0 0 1 2
undo
redo
